*5 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600</sup>, delay 40~42 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,260f</sup>.
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns as the boss.

